WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.600
Every heat plan is cut to measure.

2
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:09.440
Odisha, 1998: over two thousand died in a month.

3
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:13.000
A plan was cut. The next year: ninety one.

4
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:18.210
Ahmedabad, 2010. A city plan followed.

5
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.380
Each plan is cut to the worst heat remembered.

6
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:28.440
In 2022, the heat came in March.

7
00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:38.800
Tailors sewing for a child leave room to grow.

8
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:44.800
The worst heatwave you remember isn't the worst to come.
